WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.167
Roxy hurried out of Mara's house.

2
00:00:05.167 --> 00:00:07.949
"Listen, guys," she said.

3
00:00:07.949 --> 00:00:10.266
"I have to—"

4
00:00:10.267 --> 00:00:14.900
"Practice throwing a Frisbee?" said Terrell.

5
00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:19.521
He tossed the Frisbee to Roxy again.

6
00:00:19.522 --> 00:00:24.717
"Ha-ha!" Roxy pretended to laugh as the Frisbee dropped onto the grass.

7
00:00:24.717 --> 00:00:27.325
"First I have to run home," she said.

8
00:00:27.325 --> 00:00:38.277
"I forgot to, um, feed my goldfish!" A

9
00:00:38.278 --> 00:00:42.640
minute later Roxy was soaring over downtown Metro City. West

10
00:00:42.640 --> 00:00:46.945
Street was filled with smashed cars and buses. Roxy

11
00:00:46.944 --> 00:00:50.841
saw enormous footprints in the street. They

12
00:00:50.841 --> 00:00:55.420
pointed in every direction. "It

13
00:00:55.421 --> 00:01:00.805
looks like a giant lizard made those footprints," thought Roxy. Detective

14
00:01:00.806 --> 00:01:04.079
Smith stood near a huge pile of bricks.

15
00:01:04.079 --> 00:01:06.371
There was a broken sign in the pile.

16
00:01:06.371 --> 00:01:11.342
The sign read "Quick Mart."

17
00:01:11.343 --> 00:01:16.000
Roxy smiled. "Why did you knock down Quick Mart, Detective?

18
00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:18.826
Were they out of coffee?"

19
00:01:18.827 --> 00:01:21.492
"Very funny, Rocket Girl."

20
00:01:21.492 --> 00:01:23.456
Detective Smith frowned.

21
00:01:23.457 --> 00:01:26.153
"I didn't knock down Quick Mart.

22
00:01:26.153 --> 00:01:29.377
A huge monster stepped on it."

23
00:01:29.378 --> 00:01:31.720
Roxy looked around.

24
00:01:31.720 --> 00:01:34.670
"I see the monster's footprints.

25
00:01:34.671 --> 00:01:37.516
But where is the monster now?"

26
00:01:37.516 --> 00:01:39.480
The detective shrugged.

27
00:01:39.480 --> 00:01:41.378
"I just got here.

28
00:01:41.379 --> 00:01:44.983
The monster was already gone when I arrived."

29
00:01:44.983 --> 00:01:47.983
A woman ran over.

30
00:01:47.983 --> 00:01:50.439
"The monster went south."

31
00:01:50.440 --> 00:01:52.271
She pointed down the street.

32
00:01:52.272 --> 00:01:56.354
Then she looked across the street and sighed.

33
00:01:56.354 --> 00:01:58.379
"I'm a gardener. I

34
00:01:58.379 --> 00:02:00.904
was here to weed the public garden. But

35
00:02:00.904 --> 00:02:02.686
it's ruined." "And

36
00:02:02.687 --> 00:02:05.995
so is my car!" said an angry man. He

37
00:02:05.994 --> 00:02:09.890
was walking over to Detective Smith and Roxy. "The

38
00:02:09.890 --> 00:02:13.159
monster stepped on it!" "The

39
00:02:13.160 --> 00:02:18.008
monster stepped on my bus!" said a bus driver. Another

40
00:02:18.007 --> 00:02:20.438
man ran over. "This

41
00:02:20.438 --> 00:02:22.420
is an outrage! That

42
00:02:22.421 --> 00:02:26.039
monster tore the roof off my flower store. Then

43
00:02:26.039 --> 00:02:29.179
it ate all my flowers!" "The

44
00:02:29.180 --> 00:02:33.656
monster ate the flowers?" asked Detective Smith. He

45
00:02:33.657 --> 00:02:36.774
took out his notepad and started writing. The

46
00:02:36.773 --> 00:02:38.255
gardener blinked. "I

47
00:02:38.255 --> 00:02:42.571
saw the monster eat all the flowers in the garden too!"

48
00:02:42.572 --> 00:02:45.858
The man from the flower store was still angry.

49
00:02:45.859 --> 00:02:47.358
He looked at Roxy.

50
00:02:47.358 --> 00:02:50.498
"What are you going to do about this, Rocket Girl?"

51
00:02:50.498 --> 00:02:52.234
Roxy held up her hands.

52
00:02:52.235 --> 00:02:56.946
"Relax. I will find the monster and stop it."

53
00:02:56.947 --> 00:02:59.153
She looked at the gardener.

54
00:02:59.153 --> 00:03:02.578
"You said the monster went south, right?"

55
00:03:02.578 --> 00:03:04.828
"Yes," said the gardener.

56
00:03:04.828 --> 00:03:08.154
"That's where the Metro City Convention Center is.

57
00:03:08.155 --> 00:03:14.132
I was actually going to go there later today because—" She gulped.

58
00:03:14.132 --> 00:03:16.974
"What's wrong?" asked Roxy.

59
00:03:16.975 --> 00:03:22.187
"I know why the monster went toward the convention center," said the gardener.

60
00:03:22.187 --> 00:03:29.913
"There's a huge flower show today!"

